        <footnote id="F3">and (iv) with respect to any Class B common stock held by any person or entity in Dave Gilboa's permitted ownership group, (A) such time as Dave Gilboa is removed or resigns from the board of directors, or otherwise ceases to serve as a director, (B) such time as Dave Gilboa ceases to be either an employee, officer or consultant of the Company or any of its subsidiaries, or (C) the date that is 12 months after the death or disability of Dave Gilboa.</footnote>
